  "translation": "This morning, I got up at seven. I washed my face first, then ate breakfast. I ate bread and eggs. At eight, I went to school together with a friend. Our school is very big. We are having class in the classroom. The teacher teaches us Chinese characters and asks us what. I can write Chinese characters. In the afternoon, I go home and do homework. My book is on the table, and my cat is under the bed. In the evening, I eat dinner with my family, and after dinner I watch TV. I also like watching TV. I am very happy every day, and I don't eat fruit."
